{"seq":3,"slug":"data-pipeline-architecture","title":"数据管线架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-analytics/foundations/data-pipeline-architecture","wordCount":1790,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"数据管线架构\">数据管线架构</h1><h2 id=\"从原始事件到可分析数据\">从原始事件到可分析数据</h2><p><a href=\"event-tracking-instrumentation\">事件埋点</a>解决了&quot;数据从哪里来&quot;的问题，而数据管线（Data Pipeline）解决的是&quot;数据如何流转&quot;——将分散在客户端、服务端、第三方平台的原始事件，统一汇聚、清洗、转换、存储，最终成为分析师和运营人员可直接查询的结构化数据。</p>\n<p>一个典型的游戏每天产生数十亿条事件。以百万 DAU 的中等规模手游为例：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>平均每用户每次 session 产生 50-200 个事件</li>\n<li>平均每用户每日 3-5 个 session</li>\n<li><strong>日事件量 = 100万 × 150 × 4 = 6 亿条/天</strong></li>\n<li>峰值可能是均值的 5-10 倍（如活动开始瞬间）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这样的数据量决定了管线架构的核心要求：<strong>高吞吐、低延迟、可扩展、容错强</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>数据管线架构围绕以下关键概念展开：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>管线（Pipeline）</strong>：从原始事件到可查询数据的完整流转链路，通常分为采集、处理、存储三层</li>\n<li><strong>Lambda / Kappa 架构</strong>：批流并存的经典双路架构，与用流处理统一批流的单路架构</li>\n<li><strong>Medallion 分层</strong>：Bronze（原始）→ Silver（清洗）→ Gold（业务聚合），数据质量逐层提升</li>\n<li><strong>ETL vs ELT</strong>：先转换再入库，还是先入库再转换——决定了灵活性与存储成本的权衡</li>\n<li><strong>序列化格式</strong>：JSON / Avro / Protobuf / Parquet，在可读性、体积、Schema Evolution 之间取舍</li>\n<li><strong>数据治理</strong>：数据目录、血缘关系、生命周期与保留策略</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"架构总览\">架构总览</h2><p>现代游戏数据管线通常采用 <strong>Lambda 架构</strong>或<strong>Kappa 架构</strong>：</p>\n<h3 id=\"lambda-架构-双路\">Lambda 架构（双路）</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    R[Raw Events] --&gt; K[Kafka]&#10;    K --&gt; B[Batch Layer&lt;br/&gt;HDFS/S3 → Spark → Hive/Iceberg]&#10;    K --&gt; S[Speed Layer&lt;br/&gt;Flink/Spark Streaming → Redis/Druid]&#10;    B --&gt; SV[Serving Layer&lt;br/&gt;ClickHouse/Redshift/BigQuery]&#10;    S --&gt; SV\">flowchart LR\n    R[Raw Events] --&gt; K[Kafka]\n    K --&gt; B[Batch Layer&lt;br/&gt;HDFS/S3 → Spark → Hive/Iceberg]\n    K --&gt; S[Speed Layer&lt;br/&gt;Flink/Spark Streaming → Redis/Druid]\n    B --&gt; SV[Serving Layer&lt;br/&gt;ClickHouse/Redshift/BigQuery]\n    S --&gt; SV</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>Batch Layer</strong>：处理历史全量数据，生成精确视图（T+1 延迟）</li>\n<li><strong>Speed Layer</strong>：处理实时增量数据，生成近似视图（秒级延迟）</li>\n<li><strong>Serving Layer</strong>：统一查询层，合并批量和实时结果</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"kappa-架构-单路\">Kappa 架构（单路）</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    R[Raw Events] --&gt; K[Kafka]&#10;    K --&gt; F[Flink]&#10;    F --&gt; IC[Iceberg/ClickHouse]&#10;    IC --&gt; Q[Query Layer]&#10;    K --&gt;|Replay 重放历史| IC\">flowchart LR\n    R[Raw Events] --&gt; K[Kafka]\n    K --&gt; F[Flink]\n    F --&gt; IC[Iceberg/ClickHouse]\n    IC --&gt; Q[Query Layer]\n    K --&gt;|Replay 重放历史| IC</pre><p>Kappa 架构用流处理统一批处理和实时处理，通过 Kafka 的消息回放能力实现历史数据重算。更简洁但对流处理引擎要求更高。</p>\n<p><strong>2025-2026 趋势</strong>：越来越多游戏工作室采用 Kappa + Iceberg 的组合——用 Flink 做统一处理引擎，用 Apache Iceberg 做统一存储层（支持 ACID 事务、时间旅行、Schema Evolution）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据采集层-ingestion\">数据采集层（Ingestion）</h2><h3 id=\"消息队列选型\">消息队列选型</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技术</th>\n<th>吞吐量</th>\n<th>延迟</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Apache Kafka</td>\n<td>100 万+ events/sec</td>\n<td>5-20ms</td>\n<td>主力遥测管线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Apache Pulsar</td>\n<td>50 万+ events/sec</td>\n<td>10-30ms</td>\n<td>多租户隔离</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AWS Kinesis</td>\n<td>10 万+ events/sec</td>\n<td>20-50ms</td>\n<td>AWS 生态集成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Redis Streams</td>\n<td>5 万+ events/sec</td>\n<td>&lt;5ms</td>\n<td>超低延迟场景</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>Kafka 是游戏数据管线的事实标准</strong>。它的核心优势：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>顺序保证</strong>：同一 partition 内消息严格有序（按 player_id 分区）</li>\n<li><strong>持久性</strong>：消息写入磁盘，支持回放</li>\n<li><strong>多消费者</strong>：同一数据可被多个下游消费（分析、反作弊、推荐）</li>\n<li><strong>背压处理</strong>：消费者慢了不影响生产者</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"数据序列化\">数据序列化</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"protobuf\" data-code=\"// Protocol Buffers schema（比 JSON 节省 60-80% 带宽）&#10;syntax = &quot;proto3&quot;;&#10;&#10;message PlayerEvent {&#10;  string event_id = 1;&#10;  string player_id = 2;&#10;  string session_id = 3;&#10;  int64 timestamp_ms = 4;&#10;  string event_type = 5;&#10;  map&lt;string, string&gt; properties = 6;&#10;  DeviceContext context = 7;&#10;}&#10;&#10;message DeviceContext {&#10;  string platform = 1;&#10;  string app_version = 2;&#10;  string device_model = 3;&#10;  string country = 4;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Protocol Buffers schema（比 JSON 节省 60-80% 带宽）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>syntax = \"proto3\";</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>message PlayerEvent {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  string event_id = 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  string player_id = 2;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  string session_id = 3;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  int64 timestamp_ms = 4;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  string event_type = 5;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  map&#x3C;string, string> properties = 6;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  DeviceContext context = 7;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>message DeviceContext {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  string platform = 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  string app_version = 2;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  string device_model = 3;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  string country = 4;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>序列化格式选择</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>JSON</strong>：可读性好，但体积大、解析慢，适合开发调试</li>\n<li><strong>Avro</strong>：Schema Evolution 友好，Kafka 生态标配</li>\n<li><strong>Protobuf</strong>：体积最小、速度最快，适合高吞吐场景</li>\n<li><strong>Parquet</strong>：列式存储格式，适合批处理落盘</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"数据处理层-processing\">数据处理层（Processing）</h2><h3 id=\"实时流处理\">实时流处理</h3><p>Apache Flink 是游戏实时分析的主力引擎：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// Flink 实时计算 5 分钟窗口内的活跃用户数&#10;DataStream&lt;PlayerEvent&gt; events = env&#10;    .addSource(new FlinkKafkaConsumer&lt;&gt;(&quot;game-events&quot;, schema, kafkaProps));&#10;&#10;DataStream&lt;WindowedMetric&gt; activeUsers = events&#10;    .filter(e -&gt; e.getEventType().equals(&quot;session_start&quot;))&#10;    .keyBy(PlayerEvent::getRegion)&#10;    .window(TumblingProcessingTimeWindows.of(Time.minutes(5)))&#10;    .aggregate(new DistinctCountAggregator(&quot;player_id&quot;));&#10;&#10;// 实时 Session 化&#10;DataStream&lt;PlayerSession&gt; sessions = events&#10;    .keyBy(PlayerEvent::getPlayerId)&#10;    .window(SessionWindows.withGap(Time.minutes(5)))&#10;    .process(new SessionBuilder());\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Flink 实时计算 5 分钟窗口内的活跃用户数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">DataStream&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PlayerEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> events </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> env</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addSource</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> FlinkKafkaConsumer&#x3C;>(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"game-events\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, schema, kafkaProps));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">DataStream&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WindowedMetric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> activeUsers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> events</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(e </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> e.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getEventType</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">equals</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"session_start\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">keyBy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(PlayerEvent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">::</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">getRegion)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">window</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(TumblingProcessingTimeWindows.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Time.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">minutes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">aggregate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DistinctCountAggregator</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"player_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 实时 Session 化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">DataStream&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PlayerSession</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> sessions </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> events</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">keyBy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(PlayerEvent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">::</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">getPlayerId)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">window</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(SessionWindows.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">withGap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Time.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">minutes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">process</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SessionBuilder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span></code></pre></div><p>流处理的核心挑战：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>乱序事件</strong>：移动网络延迟导致事件到达顺序不等于发生顺序 → 使用 Watermark 机制</li>\n<li><strong>Exactly-Once 语义</strong>：保证每个事件被且仅被处理一次 → Flink Checkpoint + Kafka 事务</li>\n<li><strong>状态管理</strong>：Session 化需要跨事件维护状态 → RocksDB State Backend</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"批处理\">批处理</h3><p>批处理用于生成精确的历史数据视图，典型场景：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- Spark SQL: 计算 Cohort 留存表&#10;WITH cohort AS (&#10;  SELECT&#10;    player_id,&#10;    DATE(first_login) AS cohort_date&#10;  FROM player_profiles&#10;),&#10;activity AS (&#10;  SELECT&#10;    player_id,&#10;    DATE(event_timestamp) AS active_date&#10;  FROM events&#10;  WHERE event_type = &#39;session_start&#39;&#10;)&#10;SELECT&#10;  c.cohort_date,&#10;  DATEDIFF(a.active_date, c.cohort_date) AS day_n,&#10;  COUNT(DISTINCT a.player_id) AS retained_users,&#10;  COUNT(DISTINCT a.player_id) / FIRST_VALUE(COUNT(DISTINCT a.player_id))&#10;    OVER (PARTITION BY c.cohort_date ORDER BY DATEDIFF(a.active_date, c.cohort_date)) AS retention_rate&#10;FROM cohort c&#10;JOIN activity a ON c.player_id = a.player_id&#10;WHERE DATEDIFF(a.active_date, c.cohort_date) BETWEEN 0 AND 30&#10;GROUP BY c.cohort_date, day_n&#10;ORDER BY c.cohort_date, day_n;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- Spark SQL: 计算 Cohort 留存表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cohort </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    player_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    DATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(first_login) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cohort_date</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> player_profiles</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">activity </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    player_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    DATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(event_timestamp) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> active_date</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> events</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'session_start'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cohort_date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  DATEDIFF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">active_date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cohort_date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> day_n,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">player_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> retained_users,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">player_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> FIRST_VALUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">player_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cohort_date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> DATEDIFF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">active_date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cohort_date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> retention_rate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cohort c</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> activity a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">player_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">player_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> DATEDIFF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">active_date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cohort_date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BETWEEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 30</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cohort_date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, day_n</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cohort_date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, day_n;</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"数据存储层-storage\">数据存储层（Storage）</h2><h3 id=\"分层存储架构\">分层存储架构</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    G[Gold Layer - 数据集市&lt;br/&gt;预计算指标表、聚合报表、特征表] --&gt;|分析师直接查询| Q[Query/BI]&#10;    S[Silver Layer - 清洗层&lt;br/&gt;标准化事件表、用户画像宽表] --&gt; G&#10;    B[Bronze Layer - 原始层&lt;br/&gt;原始 JSON/Avro 事件、外部数据导入] --&gt; S\">flowchart TB\n    G[Gold Layer - 数据集市&lt;br/&gt;预计算指标表、聚合报表、特征表] --&gt;|分析师直接查询| Q[Query/BI]\n    S[Silver Layer - 清洗层&lt;br/&gt;标准化事件表、用户画像宽表] --&gt; G\n    B[Bronze Layer - 原始层&lt;br/&gt;原始 JSON/Avro 事件、外部数据导入] --&gt; S</pre><p><strong>Bronze → Silver → Gold</strong> 的 Medallion 架构让数据质量逐层提升：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Bronze</strong>：原始数据不做任何修改，支持重放和审计</li>\n<li><strong>Silver</strong>：去重、Schema 对齐、时间标准化、关联用户画像</li>\n<li><strong>Gold</strong>：面向业务场景的预聚合表（如日活表、留存表、LTV 表）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"存储引擎选型\">存储引擎选型</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推荐引擎</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>实时 OLAP 查询</td>\n<td>ClickHouse / Apache Druid</td>\n<td>列式存储，毫秒级聚合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ad-hoc 分析</td>\n<td>BigQuery / Redshift</td>\n<td>无需管理基础设施</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据湖存储</td>\n<td>S3 + Apache Iceberg</td>\n<td>成本低，支持 ACID</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>特征存储</td>\n<td>Redis / DynamoDB</td>\n<td>低延迟读取（&lt;10ms）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时序监控</td>\n<td>InfluxDB / Prometheus</td>\n<td>指标时序数据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"apache-iceberg-的优势\">Apache Iceberg 的优势</h3><p>2025-2026 年，Apache Iceberg 已成为游戏数据湖的主流选择：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 创建 Iceberg 表支持 Schema Evolution&#10;CREATE TABLE game_events (&#10;  event_id STRING,&#10;  player_id STRING,&#10;  event_type STRING,&#10;  event_timestamp TIMESTAMP,&#10;  properties MAP&lt;STRING, STRING&gt;,&#10;  platform STRING,&#10;  country STRING&#10;)&#10;USING iceberg&#10;PARTITIONED BY (days(event_timestamp), platform)&#10;TBLPROPERTIES (&#10;  &#39;write.metadata.delete-after-commit.enabled&#39; = &#39;true&#39;,&#10;  &#39;write.metadata.previous-versions-max&#39; = &#39;100&#39;&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- Time Travel: 查询 3 天前的数据快照&#10;SELECT * FROM game_events VERSION AS OF &#39;2026-04-01T00:00:00&#39;&#10;WHERE event_type = &#39;purchase_complete&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 创建 Iceberg 表支持 Schema Evolution</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> game_events</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  event_id STRING,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  player_id STRING,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  event_type STRING,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  event_timestamp </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  properties MAP</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">STRING, STRING</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  platform STRING,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  country STRING</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> iceberg</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PARTITIONED </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">days</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(event_timestamp), platform)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">TBLPROPERTIES (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'write.metadata.delete-after-commit.enabled'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'true'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'write.metadata.previous-versions-max'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '100'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- Time Travel: 查询 3 天前的数据快照</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> game_events </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VERSION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OF </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2026-04-01T00:00:00'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'purchase_complete'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"etl-vs-elt\">ETL vs ELT</h2><p>传统模式是 <strong>ETL</strong>（Extract → Transform → Load）：先转换再入库。现代数据栈更推崇 <strong>ELT</strong>（Extract → Load → Transform）：先入库再转换。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>ETL</th>\n<th>ELT</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>转换时机</td>\n<td>入库前</td>\n<td>入库后</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存储成本</td>\n<td>低（只存清洗后数据）</td>\n<td>高（存原始+清洗后）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>灵活性</td>\n<td>低（转换逻辑固化）</td>\n<td>高（随时调整）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>存储昂贵时代</td>\n<td>云原生存储便宜时代</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>游戏行业推荐 ELT</strong>：先把原始事件全量写入数据湖（Bronze），再通过 DBT/Spark 做分层转换。原因：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>原始数据保留完整，避免&quot;发现新需求但数据已被 ETL 丢弃&quot;</li>\n<li>云存储成本持续下降（S3 约 $0.023/GB/月）</li>\n<li>分析需求经常变化，ELT 允许随时重新加工</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"数据治理\">数据治理</h2><h3 id=\"数据目录-data-catalog\">数据目录（Data Catalog）</h3><p>使用 AWS Glue Data Catalog 或 Apache Hive Metastore 管理元数据：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>表的物理位置和分区信息</li>\n<li>字段含义和数据类型</li>\n<li>数据 owner 和 SLA</li>\n<li>血缘关系（Lineage）：某个 Gold 表由哪些 Silver 表加工而来</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"数据生命周期管理\">数据生命周期管理</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# 数据保留策略示例&#10;retention_policy:&#10;  bronze_raw_events:&#10;    hot: 7d # ClickHouse/HDFS 热存储&#10;    warm: 90d # S3 Standard&#10;    cold: 365d # S3 Glacier&#10;    delete: 730d&#10;  silver_processed:&#10;    hot: 30d&#10;    warm: 365d&#10;    delete: never # 保留至项目关闭&#10;  gold_metrics:&#10;    hot: forever # 聚合后数据量小，永久热存\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 数据保留策略示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">retention_policy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  bronze_raw_events</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    hot</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">7d</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # ClickHouse/HDFS 热存储</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    warm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">90d</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # S3 Standard</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    cold</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">365d</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # S3 Glacier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    delete</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">730d</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  silver_processed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    hot</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">30d</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    warm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">365d</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    delete</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">never</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 保留至项目关闭</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  gold_metrics</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    hot</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">forever</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 聚合后数据量小，永久热存</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"aws-游戏分析管线参考架构\">AWS 游戏分析管线参考架构</h2><p>AWS 官方在 2025 年发布了更新的 Game Analytics Pipeline 参考实现：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    GC[Game Client/Server] --&gt;|HTTPS| AG[API Gateway]&#10;    AG --&gt; LB[Lambda - 验证+分流]&#10;    LB --&gt; KF[Kinesis Data Firehose / Kafka]&#10;    KF --&gt; S3[S3 - Bronze]&#10;    KF --&gt; OS[OpenSearch - 实时]&#10;    S3 --&gt; GL[Glue ETL - Silver/Gold]&#10;    GL --&gt; AT[Athena / Redshift Serverless]&#10;    AT --&gt; VIS[QuickSight / Grafana]\">flowchart TB\n    GC[Game Client/Server] --&gt;|HTTPS| AG[API Gateway]\n    AG --&gt; LB[Lambda - 验证+分流]\n    LB --&gt; KF[Kinesis Data Firehose / Kafka]\n    KF --&gt; S3[S3 - Bronze]\n    KF --&gt; OS[OpenSearch - 实时]\n    S3 --&gt; GL[Glue ETL - Silver/Gold]\n    GL --&gt; AT[Athena / Redshift Serverless]\n    AT --&gt; VIS[QuickSight / Grafana]</pre><p>这个架构的优势在于完全 Serverless，无需管理基础设施，按使用量付费。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与下游分析的衔接\">与下游分析的衔接</h2><p>数据管线的终点是下游分析系统的起点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"../player-behavior/retention-engagement-analysis\">留存与参与度分析</a>需要 session 表和 Cohort 表</li>\n<li><a href=\"../player-behavior/player-segmentation\">玩家分群</a>需要用户画像宽表</li>\n<li><a href=\"../live-ops/real-time-dashboards\">实时看板</a>需要流处理输出的实时聚合</li>\n</ul>\n<p>同时，数据管线的设计也需要与<a href=\"../../game-data-driven-design/\">数据驱动设计</a>中的配置管理系统对接——A/B 测试的分组信息需要附加到每个事件上，以支持后续的实验分析。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>数据量决定架构</strong>：百万 DAU 的手游日事件量可达数亿条，因此&quot;高吞吐、低延迟、可扩展、容错强&quot;是硬约束</li>\n<li><strong>Lambda vs Kappa</strong>：双路架构成熟稳定但需维护两套逻辑；Kappa 用流处理统一批流、更简洁但对引擎要求更高，2025-2026 趋势是 Kappa + Iceberg</li>\n<li><strong>Kafka 是事实标准</strong>：顺序保证、持久回放、多消费者、背压处理，让同一份数据同时服务分析、反作弊与推荐</li>\n<li><strong>Medallion 分层</strong>：Bronze 保真可重放、Silver 清洗对齐、Gold 面向业务预聚合，质量逐层提升</li>\n<li><strong>游戏行业推荐 ELT</strong>：原始数据全量入湖，避免&quot;新需求来了但数据已被 ETL 丢弃&quot;，云存储成本下降让这一选择更划算</li>\n<li><strong>治理不可省</strong>：数据目录与血缘回答&quot;这个表从哪来&quot;，生命周期策略回答&quot;留多久、什么时候删&quot;</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"数据管线架构","id":"数据管线架构"},{"level":2,"text":"从原始事件到可分析数据","id":"从原始事件到可分析数据"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"架构总览","id":"架构总览"},{"level":3,"text":"Lambda 架构（双路）","id":"lambda-架构-双路"},{"level":3,"text":"Kappa 架构（单路）","id":"kappa-架构-单路"},{"level":2,"text":"数据采集层（Ingestion）","id":"数据采集层-ingestion"},{"level":3,"text":"消息队列选型","id":"消息队列选型"},{"level":3,"text":"数据序列化","id":"数据序列化"},{"level":2,"text":"数据处理层（Processing）","id":"数据处理层-processing"},{"level":3,"text":"实时流处理","id":"实时流处理"},{"level":3,"text":"批处理","id":"批处理"},{"level":2,"text":"数据存储层（Storage）","id":"数据存储层-storage"},{"level":3,"text":"分层存储架构","id":"分层存储架构"},{"level":3,"text":"存储引擎选型","id":"存储引擎选型"},{"level":3,"text":"Apache Iceberg 的优势","id":"apache-iceberg-的优势"},{"level":2,"text":"ETL vs ELT","id":"etl-vs-elt"},{"level":2,"text":"数据治理","id":"数据治理"},{"level":3,"text":"数据目录（Data Catalog）","id":"数据目录-data-catalog"},{"level":3,"text":"数据生命周期管理","id":"数据生命周期管理"},{"level":2,"text":"AWS 游戏分析管线参考架构","id":"aws-游戏分析管线参考架构"},{"level":2,"text":"与下游分析的衔接","id":"与下游分析的衔接"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"事件埋点与数据采集","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-analytics/foundations/event-tracking-instrumentation"},"next":{"title":"留存与参与度分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-analytics/player-behavior/retention-engagement-analysis"}}